sequenceDiagram
    participant Pri as Primary (LogStandbySnapshot)
    participant WAL as WAL stream
    participant SR as standby_redo
    participant XR as xact_redo
    participant AR as ApplyWalRecord (any record)
    participant PA as ProcArrayApplyRecoveryInfo
    participant KAX as KnownAssignedXids ring
    participant SS as standbyState
    participant Bk as Standby backend (GetSnapshotData)

    Pri->>WAL: XLOG_RUNNING_XACTS<br/>(xids=[12345,12346], oldest=12340,<br/>nextXid=12350, subxid_overflow=false)
    WAL->>SR: standby_redo (RM_STANDBY)
    SR->>PA: ProcArrayApplyRecoveryInfo(running)
    PA->>PA: lock ProcArrayLock excl
    PA->>KAX: clear ring; add [12345,12346]<br/>oldest <- 12340
    PA->>SS: STANDBY_INITIALIZED -> SNAPSHOT_READY<br/>(if !subxid_overflow)
    PA->>PA: unlock
    PA-->>SR: PMSIGNAL_BEGIN_HOT_STANDBY (first time)

    Note over WAL,KAX: subsequent records add xids
    Pri->>WAL: any record with xl_xid=12347
    WAL->>AR: ApplyWalRecord
    AR->>KAX: RecordKnownAssignedTransactionIds(12347)<br/>(when standbyState >= INITIALIZED)
    KAX->>KAX: KnownAssignedXidsAdd(12347)

    Pri->>WAL: XLOG_XACT_ASSIGNMENT<br/>(parent=12345, subxids=[s1,s2,s3])
    WAL->>XR: xact_redo (RM_XACT, info=ASSIGNMENT)
    XR->>KAX: ProcArrayApplyXidAssignment(parent, subxids)
    KAX->>KAX: add subxids; SubTransSetParent

    Pri->>WAL: XLOG_XACT_COMMIT (xid=12345)
    WAL->>XR: xact_redo (RM_XACT, info=COMMIT)
    XR->>KAX: ExpireTreeKnownAssignedTransactionIds(12345, subxids)
    KAX->>KAX: KnownAssignedXidsRemove + invalidate

    Note over Bk,KAX: standby snapshot construction
    Bk->>KAX: GetSnapshotData walks ring
    KAX-->>Bk: xip[] = [12346, 12347]<br/>(active in-flight)
    Bk->>Bk: visibility check: xmin=12347, xmax=12348

    Note over KAX: periodic compression
    KAX->>KAX: KnownAssignedXidsCompress<br/>(removes invalid slots)
